{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f55c9fe7c06915234d72aa37a11723b5b57555898c49c2b46ebe2868943a3d5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e16b41756a9285f9c642eba568b5f9704fcfa6445c1ed1934b0838a8d279d5f",
      "text": "没有不停的雨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d77e1e10e7c8f1475f328695279629470bdf4c7caffcff3d5ea8793c129117c",
      "text": "虽有才能，却因古怪言行\n无法被人理解的厨师阿斯兰，\n被餐馆解雇后在雨中漫无目的地\n徘徊。而他为了避雨所选择的，\n是某家咖啡馆的门檐下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e16b41756a9285f9c642eba568b5f9704fcfa6445c1ed1934b0838a8d279d5f",
      "text": "没有不停的雨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be9d6262fa7f0d88a6688af8732da44c6e529790e293fb14f93464dd4210e0c7",
      "text": "本年度国际烹饪大赛\n最优秀奖得主是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b17ed23d4f7196046dd6398bd0023289045b800a3e917d003f79c63374710d2",
      "text": "料理界的伟大恶魔，\n阿斯兰·别西卜II世！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d178ea0a9af82c3e332db0182994e6e35ffbf36ef155edadcc05897f0ea871f",
      "text": "（呵呵呵……谁都得跪伏在吾之料理面前。\n此乃理所应当之事！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16aebdb2e635e0eafd20d0c6487cba5bb1a8115daecd5f82a60655d3c3265878",
      "text": "吾曾如此深信。然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d2daa37b8ed0aba3ff859690cc824e60520a710f2f9f2b8d6ee6ba4148b86a",
      "text": "开什么玩笑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba4399920dd1240fa3c97f84e5ea982b30ae48074fe15322e6a05731e11bf843",
      "text": "我管你是什么伟大的恶魔还是什么东西，\n你说的话根本莫名其妙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6769518632e721e7703ab0a219d904da33ad6d0c5459290adef9e99978a614a1",
      "text": "你被开除了！滚出去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0748f332e4e8d114055d65684f8553f375a250c541d19511f41213895a13e3c4",
      "text": "……在这家店里，吾也未能被接纳吗。\n还真是诸事不顺啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409194af98a2b060faedc1d4dc09e71770d6f23a228cf93e33301e5183e27988",
      "text": "不仅如此，竟还遭苍天之泪洗礼。\n这样下去撒旦会被淋湿的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56ef5a092794609f12e5ad15a4d56d2ae172cd9481b35e394b5670c9f3fa3b5",
      "text": "能保全己身之所在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92560e938ccf882e9c66615a88f200a0a4a02d7851a5f25f6c393593cbb13380",
      "text": "（嗯。那栋建筑的屋顶，似乎可作盾牌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dcc3ab8903ad8d5686882cee981a1cc46064175f3f6ca6ef2de27ce0f370a8e",
      "text": "（暂且与撒旦一同恢复魔力吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
